# CISSP-ISSMP Study Materials

Study notes and reference documents for the CISSP-ISSMP (Information Security Management Professional) concentration exam.

## Contents

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `CISSP- ISSMP.ipynb` | Jupyter notebook — study notes covering all 6 ISSMP domains |
| `subnotes/` | Supplementary topic notes |
| `NIST800-160.pdf` | NIST SP 800-160 Vol. 1 — Systems Security Engineering |
| `NISTSP800-150.pdf` | NIST SP 800-150 — Guide to Cyber Threat Intelligence Sharing |
| `NISTSP800128.pdf` | NIST SP 800-128 — Security-Focused Configuration Management |
| `nist800-300r1.pdf` | NIST SP 800-300r1 reference material |
| `CTID Campaign Sample Report.pdf` | MITRE CTID sample campaign report |
| `CTID-CampaignReportTemplate.docx` | MITRE CTID campaign report template |

## ISSMP Domains

1. Leadership and Business Management
2. Systems Lifecycle Management
3. Risk Management
4. Threat Intelligence and Incident Management
5. Contingency Management
6. Law, Ethics, and Security Compliance Management

## Why These References

The NIST SPs here map directly to ISSMP domain content — 800-160 for systems lifecycle, 800-150 for threat intelligence, 800-128 for configuration management. The CTID templates are useful for the threat intelligence and incident management domain, which covers campaign-level analysis and reporting.

